+"point: this brings up the Color Picker dialog. If the colors are correctly "
+"adjusted, then the red, green, and blue components of the reported color "
+"should all be equal; if not, then you should see what sort of adjustment you"
+" need to make. This technique, when well used, allows even color-blind "
